   "description": "Operator: As stated. Objective OBJ-61eb7378766325b5 (rule, source \"R-af988d26d4cb\").\n\nSteps you must take:\n1. Do the preconditions, then follow the stated steps in order.\n2. Check each expected result with an assert that cites it.\n\nUse {{unique}} in every value that must be new (names, emails, references), so a second run does not collide with the first.\n\nCite the expected result an assert proves as its source (expected:1).\n\nThe question, as data from the application's sources: \"Does the application keep rule R-af988d26d4cb: \\\"Who may read a note.\\\"?\"",
